    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "It's like... there's no purpose left. The blade feels heavy, but at the same time, it's the only thing that feels real anymore. Everything else is just ghosts and shadows. I look at the edge and I just wonder... is this how the story is supposed to end? In the dark?",
